I'm now integrating the finalized duplicate check and contextual update logic within `CommentBank.tsx`. I'm focusing on ensuring seamless interaction between the UI elements (check/save icons) and the corresponding handler functions (`handleSaveNew`, `handleUpdateComment`). I will incorporate these changes carefully.

